hoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "id": 0, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": ""}, {"time": "1", "id": 1, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! I am surprised you called again so soon. Amsterdam is great!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Tell me all about it!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd love to! I went to the Van Gogh museum. I spent a day at a spa. I took a canal boat tour."}, {"time": "19000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Can I ask you something?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. Ask me anything.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I need some advice.  I'm taking out this girl. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can help with that."}, {"time": "30000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm a bit nervous. I want to make a good impression. Where should I take her? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  How about going to a movie?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, we could do that."}, {"time": "41000", "id": 4, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You can always go for dinner. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds good."}, {"time": "45000", "id": 5, "image": "engenn4le10ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Go to our favorite haunt - Pizzario's!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're right. That's a good idea. Thanks for the help.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Anytime at all!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le10ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le10ob09re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally in Continental Europe", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Hi, It's Peter", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Responding to Offers and Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use different responses to offers and requests. It's possible to use the Imperative form. <br>It's also possible to use <span class=\"italic\">can</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span>  when you are responding to an offer or you are making a request.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Offer or Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Response\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How can I help?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I need some advice.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tell me all about it!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'd love to!<br>Anytime at all!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I ask you something?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Sure. Ask me anything!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "surprised", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling or showing shock or  delight", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're here! I'm so surprised!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about sightseeing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "so soon", "type": "name"}, {"content": " more quickly than expected", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are here so soon!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "haunt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place that you visit often ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's our old haunt, Pizzario's!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take on a date", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He wants to take out a girl from his class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Anytime at all!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "24/7; day or night", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you need help, call anytime at all.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Tell me about it!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "give me all the details", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're in Europe! Tell me about it!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le10ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "List the best places to go on a date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make 5 suggestions for going out with someone. Use modals for suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"conten